{
  "abstract": "An unconditional Lean formalization of Theorem 1.2 of arXiv:2608.26062v2: a real meromorphic function has three infinite exceptional fibres on the real axis, while every other point divisor fails the Blaschke condition in each half-plane and the function is not of bounded type in either.",
